Package: simttepower
Title: Power and Operating-Characteristic Analysis for PK/PD Time-to-Event
    Trials
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Carlos", "Traynor", , "carlos.traynor.qcp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A companion to 'simtte', providing trial replication and
    simulation-based power and operating-characteristic analysis on top
    of its single-cohort PK/PD time-to-event simulator. Given a trial
    design (arms, a 'simtte' model or formula, sample size, follow-up)
    and a grid of scenarios that vary any one factor -- a model
    parameter, a formula coefficient, a dosing regimen, a sampling
    schedule, sample size, follow-up, or covariate distribution --
    'simttepower' replicates each scenario, applies one or more
    user-pluggable or built-in analysis functions to each simulated
    trial, and summarises operating characteristics such as power, type
    I error, bias, and coverage across the grid.
